<title>USA: LTV Corp board approves $75 million buyback.</title>
<headline>LTV Corp board approves $75 million buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>LTV Corp said on Friday that its board authorized the repurchase of up to $75 million of the company's common shares.</p>
<p>The shares will be bought from time to time on the open market, the company said.</p>
<p>The board also declared a cash dividend of $0.03 per common share, payable on March 7.</p>
</text>
